{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"马可·奥勒留·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"marcus-aurelius","categoryLabel":"马可·奥勒留","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/14_marcus-aurelius/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"影响与遗产\">影响与遗产</h1><p>一部作者本人从未打算公开的私人札记，凭什么在近两千年后成为机场书店的常销书、心理治疗的思想源头、以及创业者口中的处世心法？本卷要回答的，正是这个&quot;凭什么&quot;。它不复述马可·奥勒留的生平，也不解说他的思想内容，而是追踪这些思想离开他的军营帐篷之后，沿着哪些具体的路径、经由哪些具体的人，一路传到了今天。</p>\n<p>与本人物其他几卷的分工是清楚的。生平之事属于&quot;生平与时代&quot;卷，思想本身（理性、德性、控制二分、向死而生）属于&quot;思想与方法&quot;卷，《沉思录》文本的内部结构属于&quot;主要著作&quot;卷，对他功过的争论与评判属于&quot;争议与评价&quot;卷。本卷只管一件事：身后的影响与流传——即他作为历史现象，如何被后世接收、使用、放大与重塑。</p>\n<p>全卷分三章，按&quot;由近及远&quot;的圈层展开。第一章&quot;对斯多葛的影响&quot;最贴近他本人，处理他作为古典斯多葛终点与顶点的定位，以及《沉思录》险些湮没又终获印行的文本流传史。第二章&quot;历代的影响&quot;向外扩展，追踪他如何被历代领袖当作案头读物——从腓特烈大帝到越战战俘营，再到 21 世纪那场有组织、有数据的斯多葛复兴运动。第三章&quot;恒久的遗产&quot;落到最普遍的层面，剖析他留下的那种&quot;可操作的生活哲学&quot;如何与现代心理治疗汇流，以及他作为&quot;哲人王&quot;唯一实例的象征如何被塑造、放大乃至神话化。</p>\n<p>读完本卷，你应当能把&quot;马可·奥勒留至今仍被广泛阅读&quot;这件事，从一句含糊的赞叹，还原成一条由抄书人、君主、战俘、心理学家、畅销书作者和电影共同接力的、可以查证的传承链。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-stoicism","title":"对斯多葛的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-stoicism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-last-great-stoic","title":"最后一位帝王哲人：斯多葛传统的终点与顶点","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-stoicism/the-last-great-stoic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"preserving-the-tradition","title":"险些湮没的札记：《沉思录》的文本流传史","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-stoicism/preserving-the-tradition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-through-the-ages","title":"历代的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-through-the-ages","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-guide-for-leaders","title":"案头上的皇帝：从腓特烈大帝到越战战俘营","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-through-the-ages/a-guide-for-leaders"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-stoicism-revival","title":"21 世纪的斯多葛热：从大学课程到百万册畅销书","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/influence-through-the-ages/modern-stoicism-revival"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"恒久的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-for-living","title":"从军营札记到心理诊室：一种可操作的生活哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/philosophy-for-living"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-philosopher-king-ideal","title":"哲人王的唯一实例：理想、神话与银幕形象","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/the-philosopher-king-ideal"}]}]}